  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A box is sliding down a slope at constant speed. The angle between the slope and the horizontal is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\beta\"></span>. Three forces, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mg\"></span>, and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> act on the block.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>Which of the following is incorrect?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F = Ntan \\beta\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">The resultant force on the block is zero.</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">The vector sum of the three forces is zero.</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N = mgsin \\beta\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
